{"title":"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/5/56551a1cd4be3a5d996736e858917416035f3c8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1, a_2, \\ldots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"70\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/c/1bc8a878a6665cd195484034d10a3f31645305b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_1, b_2, \\ldots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"66\" height=\"16\" /> be arithmetic progressions such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/82598712aff6a240ea2d90dc29740038767e9d10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 = 25, b_1 = 75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"124\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/4/804647d12a95d26dd7341e02da16c13a9cd45c2f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{100} + b_{100} = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"131\" height=\"15\" />. \nFind the sum of the first hundred terms of the progression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/8/7785c8466cd9fe1d32a1167de1a3a121ff88dcad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 + b_1, a_2 + b_2, \\ldots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"145\" height=\"16\" /> \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/5/605c4f79db5a1a5163c9b8d2755d4074c1921b49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0 \\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ 100 \\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ 10,000 \\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ 505,000 \\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{not enough information given to solve the problem}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"401\" height=\"37\" />  \n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/c/6dcd9ab7664268badb6f02aced18add052b02f5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"28\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/f/13f31325c315b40092f883dcf986cefb178c7a3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"27\" height=\"15\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/9/809ba6a9dfbab89c4527dbd4e4ea9c2a1ce458df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25+99k_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"73\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/8/fb8b11b91024174bb6ed5875bba709f52df70d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75+99k_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />, respectively. Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/f/e1f19da211a7ea74bc1d20366fef69322fab4d41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k_2 = -k_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"70\" height=\"15\" />. Now notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/c/01c26f60e172146378e79320712ee35eb5653f39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n + b_n = 25+k_1(n-1)+75+k_2(n-1) = 100+k_1(n-1)-k_1(n-1) = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"625\" height=\"18\" />. The sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> terms is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/d/78d267b66c091e9402a276288091d9eececb2299.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\cdot100 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C) } 10,000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"192\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME\" title=\"1975 AHSME\">1975 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1975 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1975\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1975_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1975 AHSME Problems/Problem 2